      "description": "* WHAT...For the Extreme Heat Warning, dangerously hot conditions\nwith high temperatures in the upper 90s to mid 100s on Thursday\nwith morning low temperatures in the 70s and lower 80s expected.\n\n* WHERE...San Bernardino and Riverside County Valleys-The Inland\nEmpire.\n\n* WHEN...Until 8 PM PDT Thursday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Heat related illnesses increase significantly during\nextreme heat events.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...Major HeatRisk through today. Moderate to\nmajor HeatRisk on Thursday. Warm overnight temperatures will limit\nrelief from the heat.",
